- "Charleston 1: Do you know how to access the Core?"
+ "Charleston 1: Você sabe como acessar o Núcleo?"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#593 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Easy. I can just walk in...."
