#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#595 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Sigh, to enter the Core, you have to send encrypted electric signals, like this."
+ "Charleston 1: Ai, para entrar no Núcleo você tem que mandar sinais elétricos criptografados, assim."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#596 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: ...Um, maybe it's broken."
+ "Charleston 1: ...Ãh, talvez esteja quebrado."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#597 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Dr. Ve created Charleston 3 and protected her with this device. How sneaky!"
+ "Charleston 2: O Dr. Ve criou a Charleston 3 e a protegeu com este dispositivo. Que sujeito sonso!"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#598 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: What are you talking about? The Core has existed long before the Charleston Factory."
+ "Charleston 1: Do que você está falando? O Núcleo existe muito antes da Fábrica do Charleston."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#599 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Plus, Dr. Ve is a human; he can't enter the Core."
+ "Charleston 1: E além disso, o Dr. Ve é humano; ele não pode entrar no Núcleo."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#600 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Then, who was it in the Core making 3?"
+ "Charleston 2: Então quem estava no Núcleo fazendo a 3?"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#601 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: That's not important right now. We need 100 Explosive Powders to disarm that access device."
+ "Charleston 1: Isso não importa agora. Nós precisamos de 100 Pós Explosivos para desarmar aquele dispositivo de acesso."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#602 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: I'll bring them. Don't go anywhere!"
+ "Charleston 2: Eu trago. Não saiam daí!"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#603 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: I'll get 99. You get the last one."
+ "Charleston 2: Eu pego 99. Você pega o último."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#604 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: I'm already in the process of connecting to the Core. Backing out now can trigger the Core's security system."
+ "Charleston 1: Eu já estou no processo de conexão com o Núcleo. Recuar agora pode disparar o sistema de segurança do Núcleo."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#605 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: You did this on purpose."
+ "Charleston 2: Você fez isso de propósito."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#606 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Adventurer, could you bring 1 Explosive Powder?"
+ "Charleston 1: Aventureiro, você poderia trazer 1 Pó Explosivo?"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#607 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: I can't move at this moment. Please bring me 1 Explosive Powder."
+ "Charleston 1: Eu não posso me mover neste momento. Por favor, me traga 1 Pó Explosivo."
