- "Come to think of it, everything about Dr. Ve was suspicious. I mean, he relied on his assistant Charleston 1 for everything."
+ "Pensando bem, tudo no Dr. Ve era suspeito. Quer dizer, ele dependia da assistente Charleston 1 para tudo."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#692 (mes)
- "[Charleston 2]"
+ "[Charleston 2]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#693 (mes)
- "Only Dr. Ve know can answer my question. I must find him. He must be in the lab."
+ "Só o Dr. Ve pode responder à minha pergunta. Eu preciso achar ele. Ele deve estar no laboratório."
