#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#703 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Charleston 3 is destroyed. Charleston 2 escaped. Charleston 1 is damaged during combat."
+ "Charleston 1: A Charleston 3 foi destruída. A Charleston 2 escapou. O Charleston 1 foi danificado em combate."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#704 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Why are you doing this? You're a robot like us."
+ "Charleston 2: Por que você está fazendo isso? Você é um robô como nós."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#705 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Don't you care if your body is destroyed? Your Self-reflection OS is flawed."
+ "Charleston 2: Você não se importa se o seu corpo for destruído? O seu OS de Autorreflexão é falho."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#706 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Stop being a mindless robot! Stop following commands!"
+ "Charleston 2: Pare de ser um robô sem cabeça! Pare de obedecer a comandos!"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#707 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Data loss: 39%. Longevity damage: 82%."
+ "Charleston 1: Perda de dados: 39%. Dano à Longevidade: 82%."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#708 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Only the core parts are functioning, though barely."
+ "Charleston 1: Só as peças centrais estão funcionando, e mal."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#709 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Data defragmentation is necessary to repair the damage on the OS. I'll be formatted in 3 minutes. This is it for me."
+ "Charleston 1: É preciso desfragmentar os dados para reparar o dano no OS. Eu vou ser formatado em 3 minutos. É o meu fim."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#710 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Incomplete robot..."
+ "Charleston 2: Robô incompleto..."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#711 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Forsythia, you've grown well. Thank you."
+ "Charleston 1: Forsythia, você cresceu bem. Obrigado."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#712 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Don't call me that! I hate when the doctor calls me that!"
+ "Charleston 2: Não me chame assim! Eu detesto quando o doutor me chama assim!"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#713 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: I gave you that name on the day you first moved. It's from the color of your hair."
+ "Charleston 1: Fui eu que lhe dei esse nome, no dia em que você se moveu pela primeira vez. É pela cor do seu cabelo."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#714 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: ...?"
+ "Charleston 2: ...?"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#715 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: My OS is damaged beyond rep-pai... The language output has been minimized."
+ "Charleston 1: O meu OS está danificado além de rep-pai... A saída de linguagem foi reduzida ao mínimo."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#716 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: On the day I first moved? You and I are the mass version. We were created together."
+ "Charleston 2: No dia em que eu me movi pela primeira vez? Você e eu somos a versão de série. Nós fomos criados juntos."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#717 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: The mass model is after Charleston 3."
+ "Charleston 1: O modelo de série vem depois da Charleston 3."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#718 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: I'm the prototype. It took years to develop you."
+ "Charleston 1: Eu sou o protótipo. Levou anos para desenvolver você."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#719 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Your OS is identical to mine. Not a single code is different."
+ "Charleston 1: O seu OS é idêntico ao meu. Nem uma linha de código é diferente."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#720 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: You're lying!"
+ "Charleston 2: Você está mentindo!"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#721 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: I'm incapable of lying."
+ "Charleston 1: Eu sou incapaz de mentir."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#722 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: ......"
+ "Charleston 2: ......"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#723 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Your development took years. It's okay. I enjoyed this time with you."
+ "Charleston 1: O seu desenvolvimento levou anos. Tudo bem. Eu gostei deste tempo com você."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#724 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: If I were a human, I'd say..."
+ "Charleston 1: Se eu fosse humano, eu diria..."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#725 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: My daughter, Forsythia, I l-love y-y..."
+ "Charleston 1: Minha filha, Forsythia, eu a-amo v-v..."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#726 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Wait!"
+ "Charleston 2: Espere!"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#727 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Beep-."
+ "Charleston 1: Bipe-."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#728 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: The system has been rebooted successfully."
+ "Charleston 1: O sistema foi reiniciado com sucesso."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#729 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: Time remaining until the OS recovery: undetermined."
+ "Charleston 1: Tempo restante até a recuperação do OS: indeterminado."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#730 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 1: The system is inactive until the security update and data defragmentation are completed."
+ "Charleston 1: O sistema fica inativo até a atualização de segurança e a desfragmentação de dados terminarem."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#731 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: Was that a secret about my birth?"
+ "Charleston 2: Isso era um segredo sobre o meu nascimento?"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#732 (npctalk)
- "Charleston 2: I'm confused. I can't believe it."
+ "Charleston 2: Eu estou confusa. Eu não consigo acreditar."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#738 (mes)
- "[Dr. Ve]"
+ "[Dr. Ve]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#739 (mes)
- "With complete machine technology to obtain immortality drive, there are many variables."
+ "Com a tecnologia mecânica completa para obter o motor da imortalidade, há muitas variáveis."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#740 (mes)
- "[Dr. Ve]"
+ "[Dr. Ve]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#741 (mes)
- "Hmm... On a mediated machine body is still difficult, is it... Do you really need a living donor? Hehe!"
+ "Hmm... Num corpo de máquina mediado ainda é difícil, será que... Você precisa mesmo de um doador vivo? Hehe!"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#742 (mes)
- "[Dr. Ve]"
+ "[Dr. Ve]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#743 (mes)
- "Charleston 1 is reinitializing itself again. Hm..."
+ "O Charleston 1 está se reinicializando de novo. Hm..."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#744 (mes)
- "[Dr. Ve]"
+ "[Dr. Ve]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#745 (mes)
- "I've got so many things to record about this case."
+ "Eu tenho tanta coisa para registrar sobre este caso."
