- "This time?"
+ "Desta vez?"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#794 (mes)
- "[Dr. Ve]"
+ "[Dr. Ve]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#795 (mes)
- "Charleston 1 created 2 decades ago. I met Charleston 1 to learn her technology."
+ "O Charleston 1 foi criado 2 décadas atrás. Eu conheci o Charleston 1 para aprender a tecnologia dele."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#796 (mes)
- "[Dr. Ve]"
+ "[Dr. Ve]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#797 (mes)
- "I'm an observer. I'm here to record the history of Charlestons 1 and 2. I can't repair either of them, but I can wait."
+ "Eu sou um observador. Eu estou aqui para registrar a história do Charleston 1 e da 2. Eu não consigo consertar nenhum dos dois, mas posso esperar."
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#798 (mes)
- "[Dr. Ve]"
+ "[Dr. Ve]"
#: npc/re/instances/CharlestonCrisis.txt#799 (mes)
- "If Charleston 1 is reinitialized properly, she can reorganize her OS, repair the damage done to her, and reactivate another Charleston 2."
+ "Se o Charleston 1 for reinicializado direito, ele pode reorganizar o OS dele, reparar o dano que sofreu e reativar outra Charleston 2."
